  "description": "Parseur API — mailbox extraction. Official API https://developer.parseur.com/. One node; pick operation. Downloaded payloads may appear as OUTPUT file. Handler: OfficialApiNode + api_spec.json. Email/PDF extraction. Data residency is in the vendor cloud. Auth: Authorization header (legacy `Token ` prefix still accepted). Inbound webhooks: selecting the :listen operation (listen) via webhook_key ($webhookKeyRef) blocks the canvas INPUT port and compiles as a webhook-triggered Message Start (or binds to any Activity's MESSAGE Boundary Event).",
